    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University Examination Board (AKU-EB) announced the 2009 annual examination results for the Higher Secondary School Certificate (HSSC) Part I and II examinations. The top three position holders are: Muhammad Sheraz Ahmed of Tameer-e-Millat School, Mianwali, at first position with 87.64 per cent, Zohaib Ahmed of St. Bonaventure's High School, Hyderabad, at second position with 85.45 per cent, and Danyal Adil Khan of Tameer-e-Millat School, Mianwali, at third position with 84.18 per cent.",
